The aegis-engine, aegis-mcp and aegis-config modules have no third-party
runtime dependencies. The runnable jars and optional modules bundle or depend
on the following third-party software:

- SnakeYAML (org.yaml:snakeyaml), Apache License, Version 2.0
  Bundled in the aegis-gateway runnable jar; optional elsewhere.
- Apache Derby (org.apache.derby:derby), Apache License, Version 2.0
  Used by aegis-state-derby and bundled in the aegis-gateway runnable jar.
- Apache ZooKeeper client (org.apache.zookeeper:zookeeper), Apache License, Version 2.0
  Used by aegis-source-zookeeper.
- Apache Kafka clients (org.apache.kafka:kafka-clients), Apache License, Version 2.0
  Optional for the Kafka Admin source; bundled in the aegis-gateway-kafka example jar.
- Apache Spark Connect JVM client (org.apache.spark:spark-connect-client-jvm_2.13),
  Apache License, Version 2.0
  Used by aegis-spark-connect; bundled in the aegis-gateway-spark example jar.
- PostgreSQL JDBC Driver (org.postgresql:postgresql:42.7.12), BSD-2-Clause
  Copyright (c) 1997, PostgreSQL Global Development Group.
  Bundled in the aegis-gateway runnable jar and the aegis-knox3-extension
  knox-bundle through aegis-state-postgres.
- OnGres SCRAM client/common 3.2 and StringPrep SASLPrep/StringPrep 2.2,
  BSD-2-Clause
  Copyright (c) 2017, OnGres, Inc. (SCRAM client/common).
  Copyright (c) 2019, OnGres, Inc. (SASLPrep/StringPrep).
  Bundled transitively by PostgreSQL JDBC Driver where the shaded artifact
  includes those runtime components.

Apache Knox is compiled against in provided scope by aegis-knox3-extension and
is never bundled. Test-only dependencies (JUnit, Apache Curator test server and
the real-engine validation classpaths) are not distributed.

